ParentVault_withdraw
├── when the contract is paused
│   └── it should revert with EnforcedPause
├── when the share burn amount is zero
│   └── it should revert with ParentVault__NoZeroAmount
├── when the epoch is not open
│   └── it should revert with ParentVault__EpochNotOpen
└── when the withdraw is valid
    ├── it should transfer shares from the withdrawer to the vault
    ├── it should update the withdrawer's withdraw mapping
    ├── it should update the epoch total share burn amount
    ├── it should return the current epoch nonce
    └── it should emit WithdrawSubmitted
